<title>HUNGARY: Hungary one-mth T-bill yield drops to 21.44 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary one-mth T-bill yield drops to 21.44 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of Hungary's one-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 21.44 percent, down from 21.60 at an auction one week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	1,950.43 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    21.44 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     98.3819 pct</p>
</text>
